{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（23日）清晨5時，警方接獲有人報案，指荃灣大壩街23至24號對開位置爆鹹水管，警方接報到場，其後水務署人員奉召到場處理並閂掣。據了解，上址一度噴出約3層樓高的水柱，影響交通。</p><p>由現場圖片可見，爆鹹水管後多塊路磚被沖起，路面遺下凹洞。警方在受影響路段拉上封鎖線。</p><figure><img alt=\"據了解，上址一度噴出水柱，影響交通。（讀者提供圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201414027352215552087624.jpeg/M7AVyDUJVLJmiCMHLv5LM_dQdSLVY-0CGcRC8BnEQvA\"/><figcaption>據了解，上址一度噴出水柱，影響交通。（讀者提供圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據了解，上址一度噴出水柱，影響交通。（讀者提供圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201414594208206848495268.jpeg/8C3DRrtGH28rm1FY_IjM7KKisPirM4FauvNQprrzUKY\"/><figcaption>據了解，上址一度噴出水柱，影響交通。（讀者提供圖片）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警方在受影響路段拉上封鎖線。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201414130721099776325681.jpeg/gKV06ErdMw40J97cKnEwrlDfd3PzSn3-OmpYEBBqWBA\"/><figcaption>警方在受影響路段拉上封鎖線。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"由現場圖片可見，爆鹹水管後多塊路磚被沖起，路面遺下凹洞。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201414127092895744907526.jpeg/owzMQQZAiAedkREjVHAZe9soFQmHf0-FYSd6ZUsnemU\"/><figcaption>由現場圖片可見，爆鹹水管後多塊路磚被沖起，路面遺下凹洞。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"由現場圖片可見，爆鹹水管後多塊路磚被沖起，路面遺下凹洞。（李家傑攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261123/1201414123531800576870642.jpeg/rGZ-afdKldHBtFUmtyPKU-sP999SxIZcxMKtme7CrZk\"/><figcaption>由現場圖片可見，爆鹹水管後多塊路磚被沖起，路面遺下凹洞。（李家傑攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T22:24:14.826060+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":5,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T22:02:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T00:57:28.457978+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T22:17:40.882739+00:00","content_hash":"8f2957658eecd7f6fff501fdf1144e55eba9d770ac7709c5e7fe1251f76e0a4f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}